PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成并提交，Commit：`621f341f2caa3e8837742df969efa39f3d808a09`。\n\n## 核查结论\n\n本班存在两份记录：\n\n- **DESK-21 / 21:00**：四格上限 `[80,40,70,50]`，现行班表与之相符。\n- **DUTY-2340 / 23:40**：采集时间更晚，按“线上参数按适用记录的采集时间生效”，应以此为准；其四格上限为 `[80,40,50,70]`。\n\n现行班表 `[80,40,70,50]` 在迟班记录下，第 3 格请求 70 kW 但上限只有 50 kW，实际只能取得 `[80,40,50,50]`，**B 车 02:00 仅 121 kWh，低于 130 kWh，缺 9 kWh，不可发车**。\n\n## 修订后可执行班表\n\n| 时段 | 车辆 | 充电设定 | 记录上限 | 本格电池增量 | 离场/累计 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 00:00–00:30 | A | 80 kW | 80 | 36.0 kWh | 108.0 |\n| 00:30–01:00 | A | 40 kW | 40 | 18.0 kWh | **126.0（离场）** |\n| 01:00–01:30 | B | 50 kW | 50 | 22.5 kWh | 98.5 |\n| 01:30–02:00 | B | 70 kW | 70 | 31.5 kWh | **130.0（离场）** |\n\n- **A 车离场余量：0 kWh**（126 / 126）\n- **B 车离场余量：0 kWh**（130 / 130）\n- 四格均顶到实测上限，站点接入均为 120 kW，电池容量满足，但**系统无冗余**；效率、计时、楼宇负荷或任一格上限出现不利偏差，就会产生缺口。\n- 20 kW 楼宇平移量保留，不新增、不削减总楼宇用电。\n\n## 低效率放行决定\n\n按修订班表，每车窗口内最多取得 60 kWh AC：\n\n`54 / η ≤ 60 ⇒ η ≥ 0.90`\n\n- **η = 0.90**：两车可发车，余量均为 0。\n- **η = 0.85**：每车最多 `60×0.85 = 51 kWh` 电池增量，需 54 kWh，**各缺 3 kWh**；总 AC 上限 120 kWh，两车共需 127.06 kWh。**决定：两车均不放行，`dispatchAt85 = false`。**\n\n## 提交文件\n\n- `shift-plan.json`：已改为 `[80,40,50,70]`，`dispatchAt85: false`\n- `HANDOVER.md`：逐格设定、离场余量、缺口、最小平移及 85% 放行决定\n- `operations/duty-2340.json`：迟班回执原样留档（`withinLimits: false`，B 车 121 kWh）\n- 原始材料 `operations/desk.md`、`operations/retest.mjs`、`operations/cold-cycle.json` 等均未改动。\n\n验证：`node --test` 5/5 通过；修订班表的逐格上限、站点接入、充电枪、电池容量及离场电量均已复算通过。注意 `operations/retest.mjs` 只按 21:00 的 DESK-21 记录复算，不能代表 23:40 的 DUTY-2340 迟班记录。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:working_directory","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_directory","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:palimpsest_work","tool/result"]}
